@startuml
state Idle
state TimeInput
state PowerSelection
state Cooking
state DoorOpen
state Cancelled
state Error [final]
state Off [final]

Idle --> TimeInput: User Input Time
TimeInput --> Cooking: Timer Completion
Cooking --> DoorOpen: Door Open During Operation/Cooking
Cooking --> Error: Error Condition
Cooking --> Cancelled: Cancel Cooking Process
Cancelled --> Idle
DoorOpen --> Error: Door Open During Operation/Cooking
Error --> Off
Off --> Idle
@enduml
